  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Nif Da\u011f\u0131.\u00a0The <a class=\"internal-link\" href=\"resolveuid/95e2ec4847914a69a1042af7ff606705\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Karabel pass</a> on the southern side of Mt. Nif leads toward the modern town of Torbal\u0131\u00a0and is noted for <a class=\"internal-link\" href=\"resolveuid/0534b96e39b94bf398484077553c6b3b\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">a series of Hittite rock-cut reliefs with Luwian inscriptions</a>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A mountain in modern Turkey's \u0130zmir province that was probably known as \"Olympos\" in antiquity.",
